### Baremetal stub default branch

#### returns -38 (ENOSYS) for unknown syscall ids

- Verify: returns -38 (ENOSYS) for unknown syscall ids
   - Expected: baremetal_default equals `-38`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

